{"title":"Footpad","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 7 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=7\">Lv 7 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/footpad\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>6</b></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 · 8.7 · 900</td><td>9</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia%20Iron%20Mine\">Binxonia Iron Mine</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=7\" title=\"Pick level 7\"><td><b>7</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>24</td><td>7.5</td><td>350</td><td class=\"muted\">72 · 10.5 · 1,050</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"footpad\" data-map-level=\"6\">Show level 6 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia%20Iron%20Mine\">Binxonia Iron Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"footpad\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/bandit-footpad\"><img src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Bandit Footpad</b><span>Lv 6–8</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bandit: <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">Cutthroat</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">Outlaw Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"Footpad\"></div><h3>Footpad</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>6</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 7)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bandit</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>22</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>6.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>14 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}